"B<e4crypt add_key -S >[B< -k >I<keyring> ] [B<-v>] [B<-q>] [B< -p >I<pad> ] "
"[ I<path> ... ]"
msgstr ""
"B<e4crypt add_key -S >[B< -k >I<keyring> ] [B<-v>] [B<-q>] [B< -p "
">I<umplutură> ] [ I<ruta> ... ]"

